    {"id": 24, "title": "Сеть сервера · входящий / исходящий", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 31, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "Только внешний интерфейс enp3s0: трафик Docker не учитывается повторно. Включает весь сервер, не только стримы.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bps", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(8 * rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Входящий", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "(8 * rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Исходящий", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 25, "title": "Диск vda · чтение / запись", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 39, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "Bps", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(rate(node_disk_read_bytes_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"vda\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Чтение", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "(rate(node_disk_written_bytes_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"vda\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Запись", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 26, "title": "Ожидание ресурсов · PSI и занятость диска", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 39, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "PSI: доля времени, когда задачи ждут ресурс. Disk busy не равен гарантированной загрузке максимальной пропускной способности.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}], "max": 100}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(100 * rate(node_pressure_cpu_waiting_seconds_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "CPU PSI", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "(100 * rate(node_pressure_memory_waiting_seconds_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "RAM PSI", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "C", "expr": "(100 * rate(node_pressure_io_waiting_seconds_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "I/O PSI", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "D", "expr": "(100 * rate(node_disk_io_time_seconds_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"vda\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Диск busy", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 27, "title": "UDP · ошибки приёма и буферов", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 47, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "Счётчики всего хоста. RcvbufErrors входит в InErrors; линии нельзя суммировать. Это не WebRTC packet loss зрителя.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "pps", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(rate(node_netstat_Udp_InErrors{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Ошибки входящих UDP", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "(rate(node_netstat_Udp_RcvbufErrors{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Переполнен receive buffer", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "C", "expr": "(rate(node_netstat_Udp_SndbufErrors{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "Переполнен send buffer", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 28, "title": "Сеть enp3s0 · ошибки и отброшенные пакеты", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 47, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "pps", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_errs_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "RX errors", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "(rate(node_network_transmit_errs_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "TX errors", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "C", "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_drop_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "RX drops", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "D", "expr": "(rate(node_network_transmit_drop_total{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\",device=\"enp3s0\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "TX drops", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 103, "title": "BOOHTACORD · запросы, ошибки и задержки", "type": "row", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 55, "w": 24, "h": 1}, "description": "", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}},
    {"id": 2, "title": "HTTP запросов за выбранный период", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 56, "w": 6, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "round(sum(increase(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__range])))", "instant": true}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"noValue": "Нет данных", "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"}}, "overrides": []}, "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none"}},
    {"id": 3, "title": "Доля HTTP 5xx за выбранный период", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 6, "y": 56, "w": 6, "h": 4}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "100 * (sum(increase(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(increase(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__range])), 1)", "instant": true}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "noValue": "Нет данных", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 1}, {"color": "red", "value": 5}]}, "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}, "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none"}},
    {"id": 29, "title": "API · запросов / с", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 56, "w": 6, "h": 4}, "description": "", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}], "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"}}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "", "instant": true, "range": false}], "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true}},
    {"id": 30, "title": "Сервер · uptime", "type": "stat", "gridPos": {"x": 18, "y": 56, "w": 6, "h": 4}, "description": "Время с загрузки ОС; не время непрерывной работы приложения.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}], "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"}}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus_main"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(time() - node_boot_time_seconds{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"}) and on(instance) (up{instance=\"176.108.242.211:9100\",job=\"BOOHTA_cloud\"} == 1)", "legendFormat": "", "instant": true, "range": false}], "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true}},
    {"id": 31, "title": "API · P95 / P99 задержки", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 60, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "Скользящее окно; долгоживущий GET /api/v1/realtime исключён.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}]}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le) (rate(boohtacord_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route!=\"GET /api/v1/realtime\"}[$__rate_interval]))) >= 0", "legendFormat": "P95", "instant": false, "range": true}, {"refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by(le) (rate(boohtacord_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route!=\"GET /api/v1/realtime\"}[$__rate_interval]))) >= 0", "legendFormat": "P99", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 32, "title": "API · доля 5xx во времени", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 60, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "description": "Окно $__rate_interval. Общая доля за весь выбранный период показана отдельно.", "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "noValue": "Нет данных", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "null", "result": {"text": "Нет данных", "color": "gray"}}}], "max": 100}, "overrides": []}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or (0 * sum(rate(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval])))) / clamp_min(sum(rate(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.000000001)", "legendFormat": "5xx", "instant": false, "range": true}], "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}},
    {"id": 5, "title": "HTTP запросов / с по маршрутам", "type": "timeseries", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 68, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}},
    {"id": 6, "title": "P95 задержки по маршрутам за выбранный период", "type": "table", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 68, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(boohtacord_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route!=\"GET /api/v1/realtime\"}[$__range]))) >= 0", "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}", "instant": true, "format": "table"}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}, "description": "Оценка по бакетам от 5 мс за выбранный период; WebSocket и маршруты без запросов скрыты, при малом трафике точность ограничена."},
    {"id": 7, "title": "Самые частые маршруты за выбранный период", "type": "table", "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 76, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "topk(10, sum by (http_route) (increase(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__range])))", "instant": true, "format": "table"}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}},
    {"id": 8, "title": "Ответы по HTTP статусам за выбранный период", "type": "table", "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 76, "w": 12, "h": 8}, "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "boohtacord_metrics"}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (increase(boohtacord_http_server_requests_total[$__range]))", "instant": true, "format": "table"}], "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"noValue": "Нет данных"}, "overrides": []}},
